stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Proposed
  Proposed --> WaitingApproval
  WaitingApproval --> Approved: valid actor + expectedVersion
  WaitingApproval --> Rejected: reason required
  WaitingApproval --> Expired: deadline
  WaitingApproval --> Cancelled
  Approved --> Applying
  Applying --> Applied
  Applying --> Failed
  Failed --> WaitingApproval: revised proposal/new version
  Rejected --> [*]
  Expired --> [*]
  Applied --> [*]
